{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23981","headline":"题岐王旧山池石壁 · 白居易","name":"题岐王旧山池石壁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树深藤老竹回环，石壁重重锦翠斑。\n俗客看来犹解爱，忙人到此亦须闲。\n况当霁景凉风後，如在千岩万壑间。\n黄绮更归何处去，洛阳城内有商山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}